<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<!-- $title = TAKE1.txt -->
<!-- @import '../head.kit' -->

<body class="">
    <!-- @import '../header.kit' -->
    <div class="main">
        <div class="project-intro typewriter">
            <div class="project-intro-inner">
                <h1 class="project-title" data-chars="1" data-speed="50">TAKE1 Youth Screen Festival</h1>
                <hr>
                <div class="project-details-wrapper">
                    <div class="project-details">
                        <h2>Client</h2>
                        <p>City of Mandurah</p>
                        <h2>Involvement</h2>
                        <p>Naming</p>
                        <p>Brand Identity</p>
                        <p>Brand Guidelines</p>
                        <p>Brand Implementation </p>
                        <p>Marketing Support</p>
                        <p>Website Design</p>
                        <p>Website Construction</p>
                        <p>Digital Communications </p>
                        <div class="awards">
                            <h2>Recognition</h2>
                            <p><a href="https://agda.com.au/awards/results/668/" target="_blank">AGDA Awards 2019 Finalist — Websites</a></p>
                            <p><a href="https://agda.com.au/awards/results/594/" target="_blank">AGDA Awards 2019 Finalist — Identity Manuals</a></p>
                            <p><a href="https://agda.com.au/awards/results/576/" target="_blank">AGDA Awards 2019 Finalist — Branding – Small Business</a></p>

                            <div class="awards-logos wait-for-typewriter">
                                <img alt="AGDA Award" title="AGDA Award" src="/assets/award-agda.svg">
                                <img alt="AGDA Award" title="AGDA Award" src="/assets/award-agda.svg">
                                <img alt="AGDA Award" title="AGDA Award" src="/assets/award-agda.svg">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        <h2>Challenge</h2>
                        <p>Launching a creative festival to the most cynical generation marketing has ever known is no mean feat. But that was exactly what the City of Mandurah aimed to do. Before it could even launch, the festival required significant buy-in to go ahead from the broader council, a youth reference group, stakeholders and sponsors.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        <h2>Solution</h2>
                        <p>We collaborated with the City to build a compelling strategy, name and identity to get the project green-lit. </p>
                        <p>From the name to its identity – TAKE1 Youth Screen Festival ditched the tired film clichés and embraced new media to aim itself at its young, always-on audience.</p>
                        <p>A comprehensive website and awards platform was created in Webflow, allowing all submissions to be displayed on the TAKE1 website.</p>
                        <div class="collab-logos wait-for-typewriter">
                            <img alt="Cameron Murray" title="Cameron Murray" src="/assets/logo-cameron-murray.svg">
                            <img alt="Block Branding" title="Block Branding" src="/assets/logo-block.svg">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-content">
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-1.webp"></div>
            <div class="square-wrapper">
                <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>
                  <source src="images/take1-video-1.webm" type="video/webm">
                  Your browser does not support the video tag.
                </video>
            </div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-2.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-3.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-4.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-5.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-6.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-7.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-8.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-9.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-10.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/take1-11.webp"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- @import '../footer.kit' -->
</body>

</html>